"You are a company driver for {carrier_name} by choice, level {level} "
"{title}. The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, "
"authority, and insurance. Settlements are driver wages and bonuses. The "
"owner-operator buy-in stays open here if you change your mind. "
"{company_ladder_next}"
msgstr ""
"Sei autista dipendente per {carrier_name} per scelta, livello {level} "
"{title}. La ditta fornisce motrice, carburante, riparazioni, rimorchio, "
"licenza e assicurazione. I compensi sono stipendio e premi da autista. Il "
"riscatto da padroncino resta disponibile qui se cambi idea. "
"{company_ladder_next}"

#. placeholders: {grouped}, {grouped2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The buy-in costs {grouped} dollars and keeps {grouped2} dollars of working "
"capital in the bank."
msgstr ""
"Il riscatto costa {grouped} dollari e lascia in banca {grouped2} dollari di "
"capitale circolante."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "You are a company driver for {carrier_name}, level {level} {title}."
msgstr "Sei autista dipendente per {carrier_name}, livello {level} {title}."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {grouped}, {grouped2}
msgid ""
"You are a company driver for {carrier_name}, level {level} {title}. You "
"qualify for the owner-operator buy-in: you buy the truck you drive and keep "
"hauling for the carrier as a leased-on owner-operator. The buy-in costs "
"{grouped} dollars and keeps {grouped2} dollars of working capital in the "
"bank."
msgstr ""
"Sei autista dipendente per {carrier_name}, livello {level} {title}. Hai i "
"requisiti per il riscatto da padroncino: compri il camion che guidi e "
"continui a trasportare per la ditta come padroncino convenzionato. Il "
"riscatto costa {grouped} dollari e lascia in banca {grouped2} dollari di "
"capitale circolante."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"You qualify for the owner-operator buy-in: you buy the truck you drive and "
"keep hauling for the carrier as a leased-on owner-operator."
msgstr ""
"Hai i requisiti per il riscatto da padroncino: compri il camion che guidi e "
"continui a trasportare per la ditta come padroncino convenzionato."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Company driver for {carrier_name}."
msgstr "Autista dipendente per {carrier_name}."

#. placeholders: {carrier_name}, {level}, {title}, {menu_summary}, {next_business_unlock}
msgid ""
"Company driver for {carrier_name}. Level {level}: {title}. {menu_summary} "
"The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, authority, and "
"insurance. Settlements are driver wages and bonuses. {next_business_unlock}"
msgstr ""
"Autista dipendente per {carrier_name}. Livello {level}: {title}. "
"{menu_summary} La ditta fornisce motrice, carburante, riparazioni, "
"rimorchio, licenza e assicurazione. I compensi sono stipendio e premi da "
"autista. {next_business_unlock}"

#. placeholders: {menu_summary}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{menu_summary} The carrier supplies the tractor, fuel, repairs, trailer, "
"authority, and insurance."
msgstr ""
"{menu_summary} La ditta fornisce motrice, carburante, riparazioni, "
"rimorchio, licenza e assicurazione."

msgid "maintenance reserve"
msgstr "riserva di manutenzione"

msgid "trailer program"
msgstr "programma rimorchi"

msgid "truck payment reserve"
msgstr "riserva per la rata del camion"

msgid "settlement service fee"
msgstr "commissione di servizio sul compenso"

msgid "weigh station transponder subscription"
msgstr "abbonamento al transponder per le stazioni di pesatura"

msgid "owned trailer reserve"
msgstr "riserva per il rimorchio di proprietà"

msgid "authority compliance reserve"
msgstr "riserva di conformità per la licenza propria"

msgid "factoring fee"
msgstr "commissione di factoring"

msgid "insurance reserve, surcharged for your driving record"
msgstr "riserva assicurativa, maggiorata per il tuo registro di guida"

